{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":22,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於耶路撒冷的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是關於異象谷",{"noteId":11},"的預言：",{"text":"為什麼你們全都上到房頂呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們這座充滿喧鬧、騷動和歡樂的城啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們中間被殺的人既非喪身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也非死於戰場。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的官長都一起逃跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一箭未發便束手就縛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃到遠方的也一同被擒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我說：「你們不要管我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我痛哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要安慰我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的同胞都被毀滅了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主——萬軍之耶和華已經定了日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要使異象谷飽受恐慌、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"失敗和混亂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城牆被攻破，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭喊聲響徹山間。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以攔人帶著箭袋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"率領戰車和騎兵前來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吉珥人也亮出盾牌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們佳美的山谷中佈滿戰車，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"騎兵在你們的城門前列陣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主除去了猶大的防衛。","poem":1},"那時，你們寄望於藏在林宮裡的兵器。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你們看見大衛城破口纍纍，你們儲存下池的水，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["數點耶路撒冷城的房屋，把房屋拆掉修補城牆。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你們又在兩道城牆之間建造新的蓄水池，用來盛舊池的水。耶和華從古時已定了這一切，要使這一切發生，但你們既不仰望祂，也不理會祂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"那日，主——萬軍之耶和華要你們哭泣哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剃光頭髮，身披麻衣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你們卻歡喜作樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宰牛殺羊，喝酒吃肉，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「讓我們吃喝吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為明天我們就死了。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華啟示我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你們這罪到死也得不到赦免。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主——萬軍之耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["主——萬軍之耶和華吩咐我去見宮廷總管舍伯那，對他說："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["「你在這裡做什麼？你憑什麼在這裡為自己挖墳墓，在高處為自己挖墳墓，在磐石上為自己鑿安息之所？"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["看啊，你這有權有勢的人，耶和華必緊緊抓住你，把你猛力拋出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["祂必把你揉作一團，像球一樣扔到寬闊之地。在那裡，你必死亡，你華美的戰車也必遭毀滅，你是你主人家的羞辱。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耶和華對舍伯那說：「我必解除你的官職，把你從高位上拉下來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["「到那日，我必召來希勒迦的兒子——我的僕人以利亞敬，"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["給他穿上你的朝服，繫上你的腰帶，把你的權柄交給他。他必像父親一樣保護耶路撒冷的居民和猶大人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["我必把大衛家的鑰匙放在他的肩頭。他開啟的，沒有人能關；他關閉的，沒有人能開。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我要使他像深嵌在堅固之處的橛子一樣穩固，他必給他的家族帶來尊榮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["他的家族及其子孫後代都靠他得榮耀，如同杯子和酒瓶等小器皿掛在一個橛子上。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：「到那日，牢牢釘在堅固之處的橛子必鬆動，被砍落在地上，掛在上面的東西必被除掉。這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"「異象谷」指耶路撒冷。","reference":{"chapter":22,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/22.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/23.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/21.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}